---
export const prerender = false;
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { getAllSiteSettings } from '../lib/queries';

const settings = await getAllSiteSettings();
const settingsList = Array.isArray(settings) ? settings : [];
const settingsObj = settingsList.reduce((acc: any, s: any) => { if (s && s.key) acc[s.key] = s.value; return acc; }, {} as Record<string, string>);
const customPrivacy = settingsObj.privacy_custom_text || '';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy - Orandus" description="Privacy policy and data protection guidelines for Orandus.">
  <section class="min-h-screen bg-nitkkr-cream py-12 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-10 border border-amber-200/80 shadow-sm space-y-6">
      <div>
        <h1 class="font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-nitkkr-dark">🔒 Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">Last updated: September 2026</p>
      </div>

      {customPrivacy ? (
        <div class="p-4 bg-amber-50 rounded-2xl border border-amber-200 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-800 leading-relaxed whitespace-pre-line">
          {customPrivacy}
        </div>
      ) : null}

      <div class="space-y-4 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-bold text-base text-slate-900 mb-1">1. What Orandus Actually Is</h2>
          <p>Orandus is a food discovery platform — we help you find food outlets, check menus, see prices, and contact vendors directly. That's it.</p>
          <p class="mt-2">We're <strong>not</strong> a delivery app. We don't cook food, we don't take orders, we don't process payments, and we don't mark up prices. Zero commissions. Zero middleman drama.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-bold text-base text-slate-900 mb-1">2. What Info We Collect (Spoiler: Barely Anything)</h2>
          <p>You don't need an account to browse. No sign-up, no login, no tracking pixels following you around.</p>
          <p class="mt-2">The only things we might store:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside mt-2 space-y-1">
            <li>Your filter prefs (so you don't have to re-select "High Protein" every time)</li>
            <li>If you dismissed the "Install App" banner</li>
            <li>Your display name + hostel (only if you voluntarily drop a review)</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-2">That's the whole list. We don't want your phone number, email, GPS location, or wallet info just to browse menus.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-bold text-base text-slate-900 mb-1">3. Reviews = Public, So Don't Be Weird</h2>
          <p>If you leave a review, it's public. Other students will see your display name, hostel (if you added it), and what you wrote.</p>
          <p class="mt-2">Use a nickname if you want. Don't put your real name, phone number, or anything sensitive in a review — that's on you.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-bold text-base text-slate-900 mb-1">4. Wanna Delete Your Review?</h2>
          <p>No problem. Hit up our <a href="/contact" class="text-nitkkr-orange font-bold hover:underline">Contact page</a> and tell us which review. We'll sort it.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-bold text-base text-slate-900 mb-1">5. Local Storage (Your Browser, Not Our Server)</h2>
          <p>We use your browser's local storage for the small stuff above. It stays on your device. Clear your site data and it's gone. We can't see it, can't export it, can't sell it.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-bold text-base text-slate-900 mb-1">6. WhatsApp & External Links</h2>
          <p>When you tap "Order on WhatsApp" or "Call," you leave Orandus. Your chat/call happens on WhatsApp or your phone app — their privacy rules apply. We don't see your messages, we don't get your number.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-bold text-base text-slate-900 mb-1">7. Analytics (Cookie-Less, Chill)</h2>
          <p>We use privacy-first, cookie-less server metrics to know things like: which pages load, what people search for, if something's broken. No Google Analytics, no Facebook pixels, no creepy cross-site tracking.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-bold text-base text-slate-900 mb-1">8. Vendor Info = Best Effort</h2>
          <p>We try to keep menus, prices, and hours accurate. But vendors change stuff without telling us. Prices go up, items sell out, timings shift.</p>
          <p class="mt-2">Always double-check with the vendor before you trek across campus or place an order. Orandus shows what we know — not a guarantee.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-bold text-base text-slate-900 mb-1">9. Your Transaction = Your Business</h2>
          <p>You order direct with the vendor. Price, quality, delivery, refunds, allergies, hygiene — that's between you and them. Orandus just introduced you.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-bold text-base text-slate-900 mb-1">10. Third-Party Links</h2>
          <p>Maps, Instagram, vendor websites — once you tap out, their rules apply. We don't control them.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-bold text-base text-slate-900 mb-1">11. No Selling Your Data</h2>
          <p>We don't sell personal info to advertisers. Never have, never will. The data we have exists to make the app work better for you.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-bold text-base text-slate-900 mb-1">12. Vendor Corrections Welcome</h2>
          <p>Own a food outlet on here? Spot wrong info? <a href="/contact" class="text-nitkkr-orange font-bold hover:underline">Tell us</a>. We'll verify and fix it.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-bold text-base text-slate-900 mb-1">13. We Might Add Features Later</h2>
          <p>Saved spots, vendor dashboards, ordering tools — if we add stuff that changes how data works, we'll update this policy first.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="font-bold text-base text-slate-900 mb-1">14. Contact Us</h2>
          <p>Questions? Review removal? Data request? <a href="/contact" class="text-nitkkr-orange font-bold hover:underline">Drop us a line</a>.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>